sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Svc as Monitored service<br/>(e.g. Immich :2283)
    participant UK as Uptime Kuma
    participant Br as Twilio bridge
    participant TW as Twilio API
    participant Ph as On-call phone

    Note over Svc,UK: Normal operation — green status

    Svc--xUK: Health check fails (T+0s)
    Svc--xUK: Fails again (T+60s)
    Svc--xUK: Fails again (T+120s)
    UK->>UK: 3 consecutive failures → fire alert
    UK->>+TW: POST /Messages (native integration)
    TW->>+Ph: SMS: "Immich DOWN since 14:32"
    Note over Ph: Received ≈ T+3 min from first failure

    Note over Svc,UK: Service recovers
    Svc->>UK: Health check OK
    UK->>+TW: POST /Messages (recovery)
    TW->>+Ph: SMS: "Immich UP at 14:41"

    Note over UK,Br: Grafana-alerting path (host metrics)
    Note right of Br: Grafana fires webhook →<br/>bridge → Twilio<br/>(separate path, same destination)
